# Wayforge — required reviewers for protected source templates.
# Enforced by the "protect-main-develop" ruleset (require_code_owner_review: true).
# Syntax: <pattern>  <owner>...   — a path may match several patterns; the last match wins.

# The CODEOWNERS file itself — stops writers from deleting the protections below.
/.github/CODEOWNERS            @Macacoders/wayforge-maintainers

# Agent, command, and skill templates — the protection rule stated in AGENTS.md.
/base/opencode/agents/         @Macacoders/wayforge-maintainers
/base/opencode/commands/       @Macacoders/wayforge-maintainers
/base/opencode/skills/         @Macacoders/wayforge-maintainers

# Other source templates shipped to consumers.
/base/AGENTS.md                @Macacoders/wayforge-maintainers
/base/opencode/permissions/    @Macacoders/wayforge-maintainers
/base/opencode/config/         @Macacoders/wayforge-maintainers
/base/opencode/plugins/        @Macacoders/wayforge-maintainers